  "instructions": [
    {
      "type": "step",
      "text": "mix dry\nwhisk eggs, add milk (i used buttermilk), melted butter, + vanilla\nwhisk\nadd wet to dry, folding in with silicon spatula, do not overmix\nCLUMPS are good/okay do not overmix\nscoop out with icecream scoop onto preheated + buttered pan\ncook ~ 2-4 mins each side on low-med, med heat."
